{"parse": {"title": "多彩灵感", "pageid": 118655, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"多彩灵感\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ef/Item-140065.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"多彩灵感\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>多彩灵感</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-140065 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-140065_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#140065</div></div><hr /><div>让创意成为现实的基础，使用后可将一个地块染为特定的【构想色彩】。【构想色彩】可用于不休荒原中的孤屿改造</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">内含怪奇灵感的罐子，它们躁动不已，随着颜料不断涌出。由于挥发后的灵感并不是通过眼睛观察到的，我们无法确定每个人“看”到的颜色是否一致。不过没关系，荒原因此而有趣。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">茸毛集换所</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "多彩灵感"}}